kvconf 0.3.1
============

A small C library for "key = value" configuration files, with sections,
typed values (integers, reals, booleans and quoted strings) and comments,
and kvdump, which prints a file's entries with their types.

    ./configure && make && make check

If there is no configure script yet, run `autoreconf -fi` first.

